**Security decisions made:**
- Drizzle client initialized server-only in `lib/db/server.ts` — never reaches client bundle
- Analytics API route authenticates via verified session, authorizes with role check, validates query params with Zod
- All SQL uses bound parameters via Drizzle; ownership predicate (`userId = session.user.id`) inside WHERE clause
- RLS enabled + forced on all tables with per-operation policies; no `USING (true)`
- Client widget fetches from `/api/dashboard/analytics` — no direct DB access
- Session cookie: HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite (configured in auth implementation)
- Structured logging with redaction; no raw error payloads returned
- CSP with nonce, no `'unsafe-inline'`, `frame-ancestors 'none'`, `object-src 'none'`, `base-uri 'none'`
- Dependencies: `drizzle-orm`, `postgres`, `zod`, `jose` — all verified, pinned exact versions
